## 🧠 Key Takeaways

- Subnet masks determine network vs host portions  
- Network ID identifies the subnet  
- The broadcast address communicates with all devices  
- Subnetting improves efficiency and security  

## 🛡️ Security Relevance

Subnetting is important in cybersecurity because it:

- Segments networks to limit attack spread  
- Helps isolate sensitive systems  
- Supports firewall and access control rules  
